WEBVTT

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.425
In her Buzzfeed article,

00:03:30.449 --> 00:03:32.806
Anne Helen Petersen
identified three drivers

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:35.266
that I think are pretty important,

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:39.107
the first of which
is an ambient sense of job insecurity.

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:44.985
AHP: I think that the defining
characteristic of millennials

00:03:45.009 --> 00:03:47.396
associated with burnout is precarity.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:50.166
So you don't have
any of that predictability.

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:52.766
The second big thing is our indebtedness,

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.781
the fact that most of us graduated,
either from high school or college,

00:03:57.805 --> 00:03:59.636
straight into the recession.

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:03.256
And then on top of all that,
you have digital technologies,